  "text": "### 5.1 Annual Audit Plan  \n**Development Process:**\n- Risk assessment (identify highest-risk areas)\n- Stakeholder input (department heads, management)\n- Regulatory expectations (FCA, PRA guidance)\n- Known issues from prior audits\n- Board Audit Committee approval  \n**Plan Components:**\n- Planned audits (risk-based)\n- Estimated hours per audit\n- Sequencing/timeline\n- Resource requirements\n- Budget allocation  \n**Plan Flexibility:**\n- Plan adjusted for emerging risks/urgent issues\n- Special audits conducted as needed (regulatory concern, fraud investigation)\n- In-year changes reported to Board Audit Committee",
  "name": "Chunk 11/24",
  "domain": "banking_risk_governance",
